{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2022-03-28 22:57:00', 'title': 'INTUIT RESPONDS TO COMPLAINT FROM U.S. FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION', 'text': "MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTUIT INC. (NASDAQ: INTU), THE GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT MAKES TURBOTAX, QUICKBOOKS, MINT, CREDIT KARMA AND MAILCHIMP, ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL VIGOROUSLY CHALLENGE A COMPLAINT FILED TODAY IN THE U.S. DISTRICT COURT IN THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA BY THE U.S. FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION (FTC). IN ITS FILING, THE FTC INACCURATELY ALLEGES INTUIT'S ADVERTISING PRACTICES DIRECTED CONSUMERS WHO WERE ELIGIBLE FOR FREE TAX FILING SOFTWARE FROM TURBOTAX"}